<title>USA: Telco Systems in supply deal with Hamilton.</title>
<headline>Telco Systems in supply deal with Hamilton.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telco Systems Inc said Tuesday that it has an agreement with Hamilton Hallmark to supply Telco with electronic components used in the manufacture of products at its Norwood-based facility.</p>
<p>In a release Tuesday, Telco said Hamilton will consolidate Telco's procurements and streamline access to parts as they are needed for assembly.</p>
<p>Hamilton Hallmark, a division of Avnet Inc, is a California-based distributor of semiconductors, connectors and passive components.</p>
